What's new in version 0.3.0:
• Two primary actions: Save the Past (last 5/15/30 min) and Forward Continuous Recording
• Real-time streaming AAC recorder with live timeline gap preservation
• Built-in recordings gallery with native player, seek slider, and share intent
• Quick Settings Tile to start and stop capture with a single tap
• One-tap prompt notification to resume continuous recording after device reboot
• Enhanced navigation bar and edge-to-edge layout polish
